{"question_id": "q02", "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free", "set_version": 1, "answer_text": "According to the ToolBench benchmark paper, ToolBench measures **argument correctness and call order** when a model calls a function. It covers thousands of interfaces and evaluates whether the model selects the right tool, fills its schema correctly, and orders multiple calls appropriately [S1].", "sources": [{"alias": "S1", "external_id": "ag-02", "tier": "vetted_preprint"}, {"alias": "S2", "external_id": "ag-11", "tier": "lab_blog"}, {"alias": "S3", "external_id": "ag-05", "tier": "peer_reviewed"}, {"alias": "S4", "external_id": "dc-01", "tier": "peer_reviewed"}, {"alias": "S5", "external_id": "ag-18", "tier": "lab_blog"}, {"alias": "S6", "external_id": "ag-08", "tier": "lab_blog"}, {"alias": "S7", "external_id": "af-06", "tier": "peer_reviewed"}, {"alias": "S8", "external_id": "ag-17", "tier": "vetted_preprint"}], "tools": ["search_corpus", "get_item"], "tokens": 4684, "provider_error": false, "prompt_sha": "e85da7e3167b35c0723ff69ff77fbe22b7c57dd2ae8424fedbf65678832e5b79"}
